ble and natural stone throughout","e5cf8968932b",[322],[],{"_66":278,"_68":82,"_83":323,"_85":128},[],"c97a58816d63",[327],[],{"_66":278,"_68":82,"_83":328,"_85":140},[],"d57d39bde4f5",[332],[],{"_66":278,"_68":82,"_83":333,"_85":134},[],"12834a1e2883",[337],[],{"_66":278,"_68":82,"_83":338,"_85":152},[],"ef6b92bd34cc",[342],[],{"_66":278,"_68":82,"_83":343,"_85":158},[],"23a12f193411",[347],[],{"_66":278,"_68":82,"_83":348,"_85":164},[],"de574eb36a64",[352],[],{"_66":278,"_68":82,"_83":353,"_85":354},[],"Prestigious golf course frontage","6bc0db9aab57",[358],[],{"_66":278,"_68":82,"_83":359,"_85":360},[],"Approximately 560sqm (60 Squares) custom residence","e311ce228169",[364],[],{"_66":278,"_68":82,"_83":365,"_85":177},[],"2839ad7792ad",[369],[],{"_66":278,"_68":82,"_83":370,"_85":371},[],"By managing every stage of the project—from design coordination and approvals through to construction and final handover—we delivered a residence that exceeds expectations in both quality and design.","6ca1b477e11e",[375],[],{"_66":278,"_68":82,"_83":376,"_85":377},[],"The home features a dramatic double-height entrance, a custom spiral staircase, premium natural stone finishes, bespoke joinery and expansive floor-to-ceiling glazing that frames the surrounding golf course. A resort-style swimming pool and spa create a seamless connection between the indoor living spaces and the outdoor entertaining area, while every material and finish was carefully selected to deliver a timeless, luxurious home.","21f58fd85f3c",[381],[],{"_66":278,"_68":82,"_83":382,"_85":383},[],"Working closely with the client from concept through to completion, Siari Build delivered a bespoke residence that combines sophisticated architectural design with superior craftsmanship.","c1bf7876449a",[387],[],{"_66":278,"_68":82,"_83":388,"_85":201},[],"0e9fe8d1d23f",[392],[],{"_66":278,"_68":82,"_83":393,"_85":394},[],"Executing these design ambitions demanded meticulous planning, precision construction and exceptional attention to detail across every stage of the project.","8e1a3fec833b",[398],[],{"_66":278,"_68":82,"_83":399,"_85":400},[],"The vision was to create a statement residence that maximised its premium golf course location while delivering uncompromising luxury and everyday practicality. The design required expansive open-plan living, abundant natural light, seamless indoor-outdoor integration and premium architectural detailing throughout, while maintaining privacy, energy efficiency and timeless appeal.","377ee23dc1ca",[404],[],{"_66":278,"_68":82,"_83":405,"_85":219},[],"a581b14364f3",[409],[],{"_66":278,"_68":82,"_83":410,"_85":411},[],"Positioned within the prestigious Sanctuary Lakes estate overlooking the golf course, the home seamlessly integrates indoor and outdoor living through floor-to-ceiling glazing, a resort-style swimming pool and spa, and generous entertaining spaces. Every aspect of the residence has been meticulously designed to create a home that is both luxurious and functional.","af2624f57fe4",[415],[],{"_66":278,"_68":82,"_83":416,"_85":417},[],"The Tiffany Walk Residence is a luxury custom home designed to deliver timeless architecture, exceptional craftsmanship and resort-style family living. Spanning approximately 560sqm (60 Squares), this residence showcases premium finishes, expansive living spaces and carefully considered architectural details throughout.","6d3fc6ef7496",[421],[],{"_66":278,"_68":82,"_83":422,"_85":238},[],"43899506-836e-4687-9205-3fb51677381e",[432,433,434,435,436,437,438,439,440,441,442,443,444,445,446,447,448,449,450,451,452,453,454,455,456],{"_34":430,"_36":431,"_38":246},"https://cdn.sanity.io/images/f0yvhrzy/production/dc2ba4e096b1023a34ed0c4b72d770089032c96b-1448x1086.jpg","Two dark contemporary townhouses lit at dusk - Seaholme Residences, a multi-dwelling development by SIARI Build, Melbourne","seaholme-residences","Seaholme Residences","Multi-Dwelling Development","Seaholme, VIC",{"_66":596,"_68":69,"_70":5